><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This collaborative project was initiated and guided by a Pompeii expert, with contributions from students from Institut le Rosey. They composed the original soundtrack and took part in the game design, visual development, and testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was fully funded by the Fondation le Rosey, which receives no profit from its sale. It is developed and published by DNA Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fondation le Rosey also provides a classroom-ready educational version. Educational institutions can <strong>contact support</strong> for information on access conditions available to them.</p>",
